  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#24283\", \"PowerToys#48614\", \"PowerToys#47478\"], \"answer\": \"This is a known limitation, not a bug in your install. The Quick Access flyout doesn't support customization yet. You can't drag and drop utilities into it or add them from a right-click menu. PowerToys picks which utilities appear there, and using a utility doesn't add it. That is probably how Text Extractor ended up there. Similar requests were closed as duplicates of the main tracking issue, PowerToys#24283 (allow customizing the Quick Access icons). Subscribe to that issue or add a thumbs-up to follow progress. Until it ships, start other utilities with their activation shortcuts or from the All Apps / utilities pages in PowerToys Settings.\"}",
